  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/coolchengSAMA/dsh-token-combo\"><img src=\"icon.svg\" width=\"88\" alt=\"Token Combo\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<h1 align=\"center\">Token Combo · 词元连击</h1>\n\n<p align=\"center\">把 DeepSeek Harness 的流式 Token 输出变成街机连击 HUD。</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/coolchengSAMA/dsh-token-combo/releases/tag/v2.7.5-beta.1\"><img alt=\"release\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/release-v2.7.5--beta.1-blue\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/coolchengSAMA/dsh-token-combo/blob/main/LICENSE\"><img alt=\"license\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-green\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/coolchengSAMA/dsh-token-combo#环境\"><img alt=\"platform\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/platform-Windows%2010%2F11-0078D4\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/coolchengSAMA/dsh-token-combo\"><img alt=\"harness\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/DeepSeek%20Harness-plugin-4D7CFF\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/coolchengSAMA/dsh-token-combo/releases\"><img alt=\"status\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/status-public%20beta-orange\"></a>\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/coolchengSAMA/dsh-token-combo/stargazers\"><img alt=\"stars\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/coolchengSAMA/dsh-token-combo\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/coolchengSAMA/dsh-token-combo/issues\"><img alt=\"issues\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/coolchengSAMA/dsh-token-combo\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/coolchengSAMA/dsh-token-combo/commits/main\"><img alt=\"last commit\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/last-commit/coolchengSAMA/dsh-token-combo\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/coolchengSAMA/dsh-token-combo/releases\"><img alt=\"downloads\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/coolchengSAMA/dsh-token-combo/total\"></a>\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "> **公开测试版**，仅支持 Windows。功能与兼容性可能变化，欢迎反馈问题。\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"screenshots/characters.png\" alt=\"七位大模型角色\" width=\"100%\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"screenshots/hud.png\" alt=\"桌面悬浮窗\" width=\"388\">\n</p>"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- **实时连击**：每段可见 Token 命中 +1，按字符估算词元数，累计分数\n- **等级与倍率**：连击槽攒满升阶，空闲会回退/掉级，最低级才会断连\n- **七位角色**：DeepSeek / ChatGPT / Claude / Gemini / GLM / Grok / Qwen\n- **三个显示位置**，各自独立开关：\n  - 窗口悬浮窗\n  - 聊天栏紧凑徽章\n  - 桌面透明悬浮窗\n- **桌面悬浮窗**：置顶、透明、可拖动、悬停/拖动虚线、位置记忆、鼠标穿透\n- **多智能体汇总**：同一对话里的 subagent / teammate 共享一条连击\n- 音效、低动态、试炼预览、内容对齐、80%–240% 缩放"
    },
    {
      "section": "环境",
      "text": "- Windows 10 / 11（x64）\n- DeepSeek Harness Desktop\n- 桌面悬浮窗需要 WebView2 Runtime（Windows 11 通常自带）"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "1. 下载或克隆本仓库到本地目录\n2. 在 DeepSeek Harness 中安装本地插件包，target 指向本仓库目录：\n\n```text\n   plugin_manager install_bundle\n     target: <本仓库路径>\n   ```\n\n3. 重启 DSH，从侧边栏打开「词元连击」"
    },
    {
      "section": "使用",
      "text": "- 在控制台里分别开关窗口悬浮窗、聊天栏和桌面悬浮窗\n- 桌面悬浮窗默认 `Ctrl+Alt+T` 切换鼠标穿透，`Ctrl+Alt+X` 关闭\n- 双击窗口悬浮窗可收起为小徽章，点击徽章展开\n- 偏好和悬浮窗位置保存在浏览器本地"
    },
    {
      "section": "从源码构建",
      "text": "```text\nnode scripts/build-client.mjs        # 生成 client.js 并做语法检查\nnode scripts/build-client.mjs --check\nnode host-test.mjs\nnode src/fx-test.mjs"
    },
    {
      "section": "说明",
      "text": "- 只在本机运行，不发送网络请求，不保存对话内容\n- 桌面悬浮窗是独立 WebView2 窗口，常驻内存约 120MB\n- 仅支持 Windows；桌面悬浮窗需要 WebView2\n- 当前为测试版，暂无自动更新，升级需替换本地目录并重启 DSH"
    },
    {
      "section": "贡献",
      "text": "- 遇到问题请使用仓库的 Issue 模板，附上复现步骤和版本信息\n- 提交 PR 前请阅读 [CONTRIBUTING.md](CONTRIBUTING.md)，并按 PR 模板填写验证结果\n- **请不要上传对话内容、API Key 或其他隐私信息**，截图请先打码"
    },
    {
